["create","CRDWVVRFY-T3",1780769801,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Add mandatory pre-transition checklist to worker skill","parent":"CRDWVVRFY","type":"task","scope":["internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-worker/SKILL.md"],"acceptance":["Worker SKILL.md contains a pre-transition checklist with go build ./... and make check","Worker SKILL.md states transition must not occur if either command fails","Worker SKILL.md states verify-then-transition-then-commit order explicitly","make validate-skills exits 0"],"definition_of_done":"The worker SKILL.md has an explicit mandatory pre-transition checklist stating that before arm transition ISSUE-ID --to done, the worker must run go build ./... and make check, and must not transition if either fails. The skill also states the completion order: verify first, then transition, then immediately stage scoped files plus .armature/ and commit. make validate-skills passes.","priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
["create","CRDWVVRFY-T4",1780769801,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Deploy and verify wave gate skill changes","parent":"CRDWVVRFY","type":"task","scope":["internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-coordinator/SKILL.md","internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-worker/SKILL.md"],"acceptance":["make skill exits 0","grep 'Wave Verification Gate' .claude/skills/armature-coordinator/SKILL.md succeeds","grep 'WAVE_BASE_SHA' .claude/skills/armature-coordinator/SKILL.md succeeds","grep 'arm doctor' .claude/skills/armature-coordinator/SKILL.md succeeds","grep 'make check' .claude/skills/armature-worker/SKILL.md succeeds","make check exits 0"],"definition_of_done":"make skill has been run and deployed updated coordinator and worker skills to .claude/skills/, .gemini/skills/, and .codex/skills/. Grep of deployed coordinator skill confirms presence of: 'Wave Verification Gate', 'WAVE_BASE_SHA', 'make check', 'arm doctor'. Grep of deployed worker skill confirms presence of: 'make check', 'go build'. make check is fully green (lint + test + coverage + mutation + validate-skills + build).","priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
